@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@quantity = 1


### 0. 登录获取 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 1. 预热 Redis 库存
### 预期：返回当前 MySQL available_stock 写入 Redis 后的值。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/preload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2. 获取下单幂等 token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("idempotencyToken", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 3. 正常提交异步下单
### 预期：返回 requestId，状态通常为 QUEUED。
### 后续消费者会把 QUEUED -> PROCESSING -> SUCCESS/FAILED。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": {{quantity}},
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("requestId", response.body.data.requestId);
%}


### 4. 查询异步请求结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 5. 快速重复提交
### 需要重新获取幂等 token 后再验证；同一个 token 会被 Lua 原子消费，第二次应失败。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": {{quantity}},
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}


### MySQL 验证 SQL
### SELECT id, request_id, user_id, show_id, session_id, ticket_category_id,
###        quantity, status, order_id, redis_deducted, deducted_quantity,
###        deducted_at, compensated, compensated_at, fail_reason, message_id,
###        created_at, updated_at
### FROM ticket_order_request
### ORDER BY id DESC;
###
### SELECT id, order_no, user_id, ticket_category_id, quantity, status
### FROM ticket_order
### ORDER BY id DESC;
###
### SELECT ticket_category_id, available_stock, locked_stock, sold_stock
### FROM ticket_stock
### WHERE ticket_category_id = 2;
###
### Redis 验证：
### GET ticket:stock:2
### KEYS ticket:stock:deducted:*
### KEYS ticket:stock:compensated:*
